  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 3ea90144ef4ac7a4699131a7438e0496, type: 3}
  m_Name: C2
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueStateSO
  <Texts>k__BackingField:
  - <Text>k__BackingField: I couldn't remember every single detail about my dream.
      But I could remember her. Her body, her voice, the sensations. For a dream,
      it felt so real...
    TextAlignment: 257
  - <Text>k__BackingField: Tears form in my eyes, first as mere droplets, then a
      steady stream rolling on my cheeks. I swipe them with my fist, but the bitterness
      stays.
    TextAlignment: 257
  - <Text>k__BackingField: In the corner of my eye, the statuette is still sitting
      on my bedside table, directly facing me. I pick it up and roll it between my
      fingers, appreciating the craftmanship that went into its creation. Maybe I
      could find her a more suitable place where she wont gather dust as much.
    TextAlignment: 257
  <Illustration>k__BackingField: {fileID: 0}
  <Bgm>k__BackingField: {fileID: 0}
